.SH "NAME"
Docv::Viewer::Field \- The text of the search field: typing appends, \fB\%delete_back\fR removes the last grapheme.
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
\fBrequire "docv/cli"\fR
.sp
\fBclass Docv::Viewer::Field\fR
.fi
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.PP
The text of the search field: typing appends, \fB\%delete_back\fR removes the
last grapheme.
.SH "INSTANCE METHODS"
.PP
\fBdef clear : Nil\fR
.TP 4
\fBdef delete_back : Bool\fR
Removes the last grapheme; false when the field was empty.
.PP
\fBdef empty? : Bool\fR
.TP 4
\fBdef insert(text : String) : Nil\fR
Appends \fItext\fR.
.PP
\fBdef text : String\fR
